<title>THAILAND: IFCT said mulling merger of subsidiaries.</title>
<headline>IFCT said mulling merger of subsidiaries.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai industrial lender, the Industrial Finance Corporation of Thailand, was studying the possibility of merging its subsidiary brokers and finance firms, the two subsidiary firms said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;IFCT is presently conducting a preliminary study on the inpact of the merger ... so as to bolster its competitive standing,&quot; subsidiary broker IFCT Finance and Securities Plc said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
</text>
